{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":25,"ref":"1-kings 20:25","book":"1-kings","lang":"tw","chapter":20,"translation":"Na wo nso, kan asraa mma wo ho, sɛdeɛ asraa a ⟨את⟩ wo nsam wɔatɔ no teɛ, ɔpɔnkɔ sɛ ɔpɔnkɔ, ne kaan sɛ kaan, na yɛnne ⟨את⟩ wɔn so wɔ bɔne so; ana sɛ yɛnni den kyɛn wɔn? Na ɔtiee wɔn asɛm, na ɔyɛɛ saa.","tokens":[{"surface":"ואתה","gloss":"Na wo nso"},{"surface":"תמנה","gloss":"kan"},{"surface":"לך","gloss":"mma wo ho"},{"surface":"חיל","gloss":"asraa"},{"surface":"כחיל","gloss":"sɛdeɛ asraa"},{"surface":"הנפל","gloss":"a wɔatɔ"},{"surface":"מאותך","gloss":"⟨את⟩ wo nsam","marks":"asraa a wɔatɔ no"},{"surface":"וסוס","gloss":"ɔpɔnkɔ"},{"surface":"כסוס","gloss":"sɛ ɔpɔnkɔ"},{"surface":"ורכב","gloss":"ne kaan"},{"surface":"כרכב","gloss":"sɛ kaan"},{"surface":"ונלחמה","gloss":"na yɛnne so"},{"surface":"אותם","gloss":"⟨את⟩ wɔn","marks":"wɔn so wɔ bɔne so"},{"surface":"במישור","gloss":"wɔ bɔne so"},{"surface":"אם","gloss":"ana sɛ"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"nnɛ"},{"surface":"נחזק","gloss":"yɛdi den"},{"surface":"מהם","gloss":"kyɛn wɔn"},{"surface":"וישמע","gloss":"Na ɔtiee"},{"surface":"לקלם","gloss":"wɔn asɛm"},{"surface":"ויעש","gloss":"na ɔyɛɛ"},{"surface":"כן","gloss":"saa"}],"timestamp":"2026-09-15T23:25:41.398034555Z","model":"glm-5.3"}